            code:workflow/plans/flow/references/proposals/plan-task-coverage-2026-11-11.md): own audit mode,
            HiddenFilter and UndeclaredEffect (E12), and runtimeSetup's repairSlots and audit options (R12), with the O2
            to O5 outcomes cited below.

